WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.240
The evaluation contract
has several layers.

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:05.200
Task outcomes need
representative expectations.

00:00:05.337 --> 00:00:09.760
Retrieval needs relevant, permitted
evidence and correct citations.

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:14.240
Agent actions need checks on tool
choice, arguments and termination.

00:00:14.387 --> 00:00:17.840
Model judges need calibration
against expert labels.

00:00:17.944 --> 00:00:23.320
Operation needs latency, cost,
drift and fallback evidence.

00:00:23.394 --> 00:00:25.760
Report results by meaningful scenario.

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:28.320
A single average score
cannot explain whether

00:00:28.373 --> 00:00:30.720
every critical behavior
remains acceptable.
